## Implementation

Implementation commit: `62bbb86a75f545d068bf64b5453753a070debee2`.

The implementation adds a strict Sales projection boundary in
`packages/domain/src/sales-mastery.ts`. It validates active Sales Company
Identity claims, binds the learner to `sales:<sub>`, and rejects caller tenant
fields, wrong audiences, cross-organization access, graph drift, and binding
drift.

The database change adds the mapping, outbox, and receipt tables. The mapping
uses a dedicated `schools` namespace and rejects the reserved Codecamp UUID.
The outbox stores organization, learner, source, graph, rubric, request,
correlation, payload, and digest identity. Immutable triggers reject mutation.
The journal entry is serial at index 53. Snapshot `0053_snapshot.json` and the
Sales tenant registry classifications are included.

The projection uses the existing Mastery persistence port. Equal identities
return the original receipt. Conflicting identities fail with
`IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT`. Pending deliveries remain retryable, and receipts are
append-only inserts.

